Redistribution license record for worker-f 0.1.20

The published worker-f 0.1.20 npm package declares the SPDX license
expression MIT in package.json but does not ship a license text file. The
package metadata identifies the author as catamphetamine and links to
https://gitlab.com/catamphetamine/worker-f. The standard MIT text below is
included by Activation Energy Studio for redistribution clarity; it is a
curated fallback record, not a file copied from the worker-f package archive.

